745,"y":1836,"width":160,"height":36}]},{"text":"• 최초 적합. 첫 번째 사용 기능한 가용 공간을 할당한다. 검색은 집합의 시작에서부터","words":[{"text":"•","x":337,"y":1935,"width":14,"height":14},{"text":"최초","x":378,"y":1927,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"적합.","x":456,"y":1927,"width":72,"height":35},{"text":"첫","x":544,"y":1928,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"번째","x":589,"y":1927,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"사용","x":663,"y":1927,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"기능한","x":738,"y":1927,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"가용","x":844,"y":1927,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"공간을","x":915,"y":1926,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"할당한다.","x":1018,"y":1925,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"검색은","x":1164,"y":1926,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"집합의","x":1270,"y":1926,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"시작에서부터","x":1377,"y":1927,"width":189,"height":38}]},{"text":"하거나 지난번 검색이 끝났던 곳에서 시작될 수 있다. 충분히 큰 가용 공간을 찾았을","words":[{"text":"하거나","x":377,"y":1987,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"지난번","x":490,"y":1987,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"검색이","x":600,"y":1987,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"끝났던","x":705,"y":1986,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"곳에서","x":811,"y":1987,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"시작될","x":915,"y":1986,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1017,"y":1986,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1061,"y":1986,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"충분히","x":1141,"y":1986,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"큰","x":1246,"y":1989,"width":32,"height":32},{"text":"가용","x":1290,"y":1986,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"공간을","x":1365,"y":1988,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"찾았을","x":1474,"y":1989,"width":97,"height":35}]},{"text":"때 검색을 끝낼 수 있다","words":[{"text":"때","x":379,"y":2047,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"검색을","x":424,"y":2047,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"끝낼","x":533,"y":2048,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":609,"y":2048,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"있다","x":655,"y":2047,"width":68,"height":36}]},{"text":"• 최적 적합. 사용 가능한 공간 중에서 가장 작은 것을 택한다. 리스트가 크기 순으로","words":[{"text":"•","x